
Usage: /BG [<note>]
  Exit  the  conference  temporary.   BG  stands  for BackGround.  You
  should  get  back  within  the allowable time frame.  In essence, it
  allows you to "switch" tasks.  To get back, enter the conference the
  same  way you came in (from whatever menu option you came from).  If
  you don't get back in time, your session will be terminated, and the
  next time you enter you'll start from fresh.

  Example:
     /BG Checking e-mail

  See Also:
     /AWAY

